  "question_id": "q_073_sql_bloomberg_stock_monthly_change",
  "slug": "sql-bloomberg-stock-monthly-change",
  "title": "FAANG Stock Monthly Change (Part 2)",
  "difficulty": "Medium",
  "company": "Bloomberg",
  "premium": true,
  "question": "Bloomberg portfolio managers evaluate monthly price momentum across equities.\n\nFor each stock, calculate the change in closing price comparing the current calendar month to the previous calendar month.\n\nUse each month's last recorded closing price. Output `ticker`, `month` (formatted `'YYYY-MM'`), `month_close` and `change_vs_prev_month` (NULL for a ticker's first month), ordered by `ticker` and `month`.",
